The Real Spill with Kid &amp; Watts Talks Jay-Z 4:44, Lonzo &amp; More. The Real Spill contributors consisting of Kidd and Watts Discuss on this week's episode share their thoughts on the Jay-Z new album "4:44". They also dive into Mike Vick's comments on Colin Kaepernick needs to cut his hair and change his image to get another opportunity to play in the NFL. They even talk about Lonzo Ball &amp; trying to be his own man while breaking out of the shadows of his father.  Take a listen to the full interview below.

